    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Horde Won't Stop is a Third Person Shooter in a zombie post apocalyptical world. The aim is to survive as long as possible. Each level becomes progressively more difficult with more zombies to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/extras/a00f4b4349a45659ed2406833197d6dd.avif?t=1752398706\" width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have time to buy weapons after each level has been completed. You have a wide range of firearms, grenades, melee weapons and upgrades to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/extras/d1ebdd8882a6d6cb9c67a225b08c4ce6.avif?t=1752398706\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have full control over every action which includes moving, aiming, shooting, throwing grenades and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several different types of zombies to keep things interesting and to make it more challenging for the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Horde Won't Stop is a Third Person Shooter in a zombie post apocalyptical world. The aim is to survive as long as possible. Each level becomes progressively more difficult with more zombies to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/extras/a00f4b4349a45659ed2406833197d6dd.avif?t=1752398706\" width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have time to buy weapons after each level has been completed. You have a wide range of firearms, grenades, melee weapons and upgrades to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/extras/d1ebdd8882a6d6cb9c67a225b08c4ce6.avif?t=1752398706\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have full control over every action which includes moving, aiming, shooting, throwing grenades and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several different types of zombies to keep things interesting and to make it more challenging for the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
